      "finding": "All three platforms selected `Ascending.base` and exposed an active Bases view with 10 results. The probe discovered group headings and row paths, but classified each row as inside the first `.bases-table` only. Obsidian renders each group in its own `.bases-table`, so rows under Bravo, Zulu, and None were collected as unscoped rows and omitted from `row_order_by_group_from_dom`; the probe then failed first-open acceptance. No C07 semantic parity conclusion can be drawn from this capture."
